  "item.simpleovens.guide_book": "Simple Ovens Guide",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.1.title": "Simple Ovens",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.1": "Reinforced, Netherite and Enderite furnaces, smokers and blast furnaces that cook 2, 4 and 8 times as fast, and furnace minecarts of the same tiers.",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.2.title": "Faster Furnaces: Reinforced, Netherite and Enderite",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.2": "Three upgraded tiers of the furnace, the smoker and the blast furnace. They use the recipes and menus of their Vanilla counterparts but cook 2, 4 and 8 times as fast;",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.3.title": "Faster Furnaces: Reinforced, Netherite and Enderite",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.3": "Netherite and Enderite give double experience. The Reinforced tier is crafted, the Netherite and Enderite tiers are upgraded in the world.",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.4.title": "In-World Upgrade",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.4": "A placed Reinforced machine becomes the Netherite one with a Netherite Nugget in the off hand, a Netherite machine the Enderite one with an Enderite Nugget.",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.5.title": "In-World Upgrade",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.5": "On its own the axe strikes it; with SimpleBuilding only its sledgehammer does.",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.6.title": "Furnace Minecarts",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.6": "Reinforced, Netherite and Enderite furnace minecarts: one fuel item burns 2, 4 or 8 times as long as in Vanilla's furnace cart (the speed of the furnace of the tier),",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.7.title": "Furnace Minecarts",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.7": "and the cart runs at 5/8, 3/4 or all of a plain minecart's top speed.",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.8.title": "Furnace Boats",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.8": "A Vanilla boat with a furnace where the chest boat has its chest: you steer, the furnace pushes. One furnace boat per Vanilla wood (plus a bamboo raft) and per furnace: the plain furnace, Reinforced, Netherite and Enderite.",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.9.title": "Long Cook Times in the Menu",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.9": "Furnace menus send their timers as shorts; cook times above 32767 ticks are divided before sending, so the arrow and the flame keep the right ratio.",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.10.title": "Moved from SimpleBuilding",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.10": "The furnaces, their block entities, the furnace carts, their 8 recipes and recipe unlocks were SimpleBuilding's (simplebuilding:*).",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.11.title": "Moved from SimpleBuilding",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.11": "Old worlds load them under simpleovens:* through SimpleLib's id moves and save the new ids.",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.12.title": "Creative tabs",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.12": "The module's items sit in its own creative tab only (no Vanilla tabs).",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.13.title": "Commands",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.13": "/simpleovens config shows and changes every option of config/simpleovens-server.json (list [group], get, set, reset, help; Tab completes options and values).",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.14.title": "Commands",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.14": "Values are bounded like in the file, saved at once and take effect at once; options read only at start say so. Permission level 2.",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.15.title": "Settings",
  "simpleovens.guide.page.15": "More settings are in the mod's config screen.",
  "quests.simpleovens.start.title": "Welcome to Simple Ovens",
  "quests.simpleovens.start.subtitle": "Your free guide",
  "quests.simpleovens.start.welcome.title": "A free guide",
  "quests.simpleovens.start.welcome.description": "Craft or pick up a crafting table and claim the Simple Ovens Guide as a reward. You can also craft it from a book and charcoal."
}
